assume it AT LEAST stays out, because it still needs to execute its &quot;Play the top card of the env. deck&quot; action.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I realize this is SIMILAR to the discussion occuring in http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/forum/topic/quick-terminology-clarification-played-and-first-time&nbsp;but I thought it was sufficiently different to merit its own thread.</p>",
